t(9, 1310, """A message to every father and mother, and an awareness message to society

Wherever you go in the east and west of the earth you will see something of this .. These are a door that breaks, and when it breaks, do not ask about the disasters .. These are upon the nature of their father Adam and the nature of the prophets, peace be upon them .. Their father Adam who believed Iblis when he swore to him by Allah, and thought all creatures were truthful .. Iblis betrayed our father Adam and our father Adam was punished. But after Adam, peace be upon him, woke up and became aware of the reality of the creatures around him, that among them are liars, among them are those who scheme, and among them are those who oppress, was he after that the same first Adam before Iblis schemed against him? The answer is no.

In society there are individuals, in varying proportions, who are upon the first nature. Do not break them, because the result is either reformers on earth or tyrannical, hard-hearted, criminal transgressors, because the shock of discovering the truth causes a great earthquake in the soul.

To every father and mother whom Allah has granted offspring like this:

Watch your children in particular. If you see them like this, do not humiliate them, do not mistreat them, do not tell them "You are hopeless", do not tell them "You are less than others (who understand scheming, deception and evil)", for your children are not hopeless and not less than others. In them is something of their father Adam and of the prophets, peace be upon them, but you as a father and as a mother do not grasp this blessing .. In your home there is something pure that Allah, Exalted, created, and its soul preserved the original nature .. You will find these children seem naive .. This is not naivety. They will be broken .. Do not rush them .. Society will break them one day and they will not stay like this upon the original nature, but when society breaks them, at that moment you as fathers and mothers have the duty to be aware of that moment and ready for it, to embrace them, not to punish and torment them as happens! For it will be a very harsh moment for them, and without these words of mine you will not understand the truth. They will suffer greatly when they discover the truth.

When they are broken and collapse, as happened to our father Adam, peace be upon him, the care of Allah the Mighty will receive them as it received our father Adam, peace be upon him. But you fathers and mothers carry a responsibility; our father Adam had no father and mother, but your children do .. In that hard, painful moment they will need you to weep on your chests.

Do not be harsh as happened to many .. who were broken and found harshness, insult, humiliation, dryness, coldness and blame, over the most beautiful thing Allah, Exalted, created in the soul: the sound original nature.

Do not make them suffer on top of their great pain .. They are not disabled .. and their nature is not proof of stupidity .. The matter has nothing to do with their mental abilities .. They seem naive because of their Adamic nature from Adam, peace be upon him.""")

