t(14, 1710, """Something I learned not a short time ago, maybe 5 years, and whenever I remembered it to explain it, something else occupied me and made me forget it

For thousands of years our ancestors slept at the time of Isha, then woke in the middle of the night for two or three hours, then went back to sleep until Fajr, then woke with full energy and vigor .. Throughout thousands of years none of them said he suffered from the lie of (insomnia), because insomnia is a new lie 100 years old .. There is no such thing as insomnia .. There is sleep poisoning .. We are all afflicted with sleep poisoning .. Sleep poisoning means our bodies do not sleep naturally because of the lie of sleeping 8 hours .. one of the biggest lies of the last hundred years .. Our bodies were never created to sleep 8 continuous hours .. This destruction of the nature with which our bodies were created was contributed to by - in a thousand quotation marks - doctors and specialists who cooperated with global capitalism, which manufactured this lie to secure greater production for its factories. Humanity moved from natural, innate sleep that is restful for body, soul and spirit and supports a person's vigor, to 8 continuous hours of sleep, which is sleep that ruins the body, wrecks energy and exhausts the soul, because our bodies were not designed to sleep this way. So dozens of times over the year the body grows restless, objects, shakes off and revolts against the 8-hour system, and the person is perplexed and says: What is happening? Why is my sleep ruined? Why do I have insomnia?!

O poor man of this century .. O you, me and all of us .. We are all poor; even the sleep that Allah, Exalted, created was not safe from their evil, their scheming and their crimes. O man: there is no such thing as insomnia .. There is no such thing as insomnia .. What happens to you is your body trying to return to the nature of its creation .. trying to return to the nature upon which Allah, Exalted, created us in sleep .. What is happening is exactly the opposite of your belief .. your belief, fed by the media for 100 years, that you should go swallow sleeping pills ..""")

t(15, 60, """Sleep right after the Isha prayer, because this is the natural way, and if you do not keep to the natural way you ruin the nature of your sleep with your own hands. And if you ruin the nature of your sleep with your own hands, you have tampered with your proper sleeping hour, and everything that results from this tampering is fatigue, exhaustion, scattered mind, restlessness from sleep 50 times a night and the worst possible life, or a sleep that people sleep like the sleep of death, waking neither for night prayer nor for the Fajr prayer .. What happened is that man tampered with his sleep and ruined it with his own hand.

To everyone who sleeps after Isha and wakes at 12 at night for two or three hours:

Do not panic .. You are fine .. This is not insomnia .. This is recovery .. This is healing .. Your body, by Allah's power, is recovering and returning to the origin of its creation .. returning to the original nature of sleep upon which it was created, which our ancestors lived since our father Adam descended to earth .. Wake up .. pray .. read .. glorify and seek forgiveness .. do something useful .. anything useful .. Gradually your body, by the power of Allah, Exalted, will get used to it and you will return to the natural way, Allah, Exalted, willing.""")

